SSFD - K_SFXDAT.INC, a recorded sound bank
  a Sound Blaster answered: the sounds go into the ring
  OWL FLY III SFX.DAT loaded, sounds: 7
PASS S1 SFD_LOAD read the bank and its count
PASS S2 every sound mixed, one past the bank ignored
PASS S3 SFD_FREE twice: the 64K back
PASS S4 no file: CF=1, no memory kept, SFD_PLAY returns
SSFD done
